// One-bit wire-like combinational circuit. Same as a short path from input to
// output. Same as a short path in a net -> the propagation delay is
// instantaneous. Same as a short path in a combinational chain, the function
// of the module is just the same as the function of the individual gates
// (and, or, xor, not, etc) along the path, not dependent on the path length.
module TopModule(input  in, output out);
  assign out = in;
endmodule

